d contrasts with this paper; method defines its symbols; the experiments text interprets tables rather than repeating them; no filler or repeated paragraphs; limitations are candid.\nRecord what you checked and what you asked to change in your review record. Approve only when the checks pass.\n\nAs reviewer, run the same three finish-gate commands yourself on the delivered files; if any flags a problem, open an issue instead of approving.\n"
       }
